[219.124029, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m14\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[219.124666, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe C side is fine, but the Python fast-doubling base case returns an integer while its caller unpacks a pair. I’ll correct it to return `(F(n), F(n+1))` \r\nthroughout.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\np = Path('/app/polyglot/main.py.c')\r\ns = p.read_text()\r\nold = '''def fibonacci(n: int) -> int:\r\n    \"\"\"Return F(n) using fast doubling.\"\"\"\r\n    if n == 0:\r\n        return 0\r\n    a, b = fibonacci(n >> 1)\r\n    c = a * ((b << 1) - a)\r\n    d = a * a + b * b\r\n    return d if n & 1 else c\r\n'''\r\nnew = '''def fibonacci_pair(n: int) -> tuple[int, int]:\r\n    \"\"\"Return (F(n), F(n + 1)) using fast doubling.\"\"\"\r\n    if n == 0:\r\n        return (0, 1)\r\n    a, b = fibonacci_pair(n >> 1)\r\n    c = a * ((b << 1) - a)\r\n    d = a * a + b * b\r\n    return (d, c + d) if n & 1 else (c, d)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef fibonacci(n: int) -> int:\r\n    return fibonacci_pair(n)[0]\r\n'''\r\nassert old in s\r\np.write_text(s.replace(old, new))\r\nPY\r\npython3 -m py_compile /app/polyglot/main.py.c && echo PY_COMPILE_OK\r\ngcc /app/polyglot/main.py.c -o /app/polyglot/cmain && echo GCC_OK\r\nfor n in 0 1 2 3 4 5 10 20 50 90 92 93 100 500 1000 5000 10000; do\r\n  py=$(python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c \"$n\")\r\n  c=$(/app/polyglot/cmain \"$n\")\r\n  if [ \"$py\" != \"$c\" ]; then\r\n    echo \"MISMATCH n=$n\"; echo \"python=$py\"; echo \"c=$c\"; exit 1\r\n  fi\r\ndone\r\necho \"SAMPLES_MATCH\"\r\nfor n in $(seq 0 300); do\r\n  chk=$(/app/polyglot/cmain \"$n\")\r\n  expected=$(python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c \"$n\")\r\n  [ \"$chk\" = \"$expected\" ] || { echo \"MISMATCH at $n\"; exit 1; }\r\ndone\r\necho \"RANGE_0_300_MATCH\"\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[219.125489, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[222.381242, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[222.381424, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nPY_COMPILE_OK\r\nGCC_OK\r\nSAMPLES_MATCH\r\nRANGE_0_300_MATCH\r\n\r\n"]
