[256.245796, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m15\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[256.246928, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe core tests pass. One Python 3.12-specific edge remains: converting very large Fibonacci integers to decimal text is limited by default \r\n(`int_max_str_digits`). I’ll disable that limit so Python can print large results just as the C big-integer code can.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\np = Path('/app/polyglot/main.py.c')\r\ns = p.read_text()\r\nold = '''#if 0\r\nimport sys\r\n\r\n\r\ndef fibonacci_pair'''\r\nnew = '''#if 0\r\nimport sys\r\n\r\nif hasattr(sys, \"set_int_max_str_digits\"):\r\n    sys.set_int_max_str_digits(0)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef fibonacci_pair'''\r\nassert old in s\r\np.write_text(s.replace(old, new))\r\nPY\r\npython3 -m py_compile /app/polyglot/main.py.c\r\ngcc /app/polyglot/main.py.c -o /app/polyglot/cmain\r\nprintf 'f(0): '; python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 0\r\nprintf 'f(1): '; python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 1\r\nprintf 'f(10): '; python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 10\r\nprintf 'f(100): '; python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 100\r\nprintf 'C f(100): '; /app/polyglot/cmain 100\r\nfor args in '' 'abc' '-1'; do\r\n  echo \"--- args=[$args] ---\"\r\n  python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c $args >/tmp/py.out 2>/tmp/py.err; echo \"python rc=$? out=$(cat /tmp/py.out) err=$(cat /tmp/py.err)\"\r\n  /app/polyglot/cmain $args >/tmp/c.out 2>/tmp/c.err; echo \"c rc=$? out=$(cat /tmp/c.out) err=$(cat /tmp/c.err)\"\r\ndone\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[256.2474, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[256.475732, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[256.476133, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nf(0): 0\r\nf(1): 1\r\nf(10): 55\r\nf(100): 354224848179261915075\r\nC f(100): 354224848179261915075\r\n--- args=[] ---\r\npython rc=1 out= err=Usage: /app/polyglot/main.py.c N\r\nc rc=1 out= err=Usage: /app/polyglot/cmain N\r\n--- args=[abc] ---\r\npython rc=1 out= err=N must be a non-negative integer\r\nc rc=1 out= err=N must be a non-negative integer\r\n--- args=[-1] ---\r\npython rc=1 out= err=N must be a non-negative integer\r\nc rc=1 out= err=N must be a non-negative integer\r\n\r\n"]
