[259.484878, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m16\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[259.485513, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll now stress-test a large index to make sure both implementations remain consistent and to measure whether the C iterative big-integer path needs \r\noptimization.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\n/usr/bin/time -f 'C time=%e sec maxrss=%M KB' /app/polyglot/cmain 100000 > /tmp/c100k.txt\r\n/usr/bin/time -f 'Python time=%e sec maxrss=%M KB' python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 100000 > /tmp/py100k.txt\r\nwc -c /tmp/c100k.txt /tmp/py100k.txt\r\ncmp /tmp/c100k.txt /tmp/py100k.txt && echo LARGE_MATCH\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
