[262.485533, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m17\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[262.486199, "o", "\r\u001b[2K`/usr/bin/time` is unavailable, so I’ll use `timeout` and shell timestamps instead to validate the 100,000th Fibonacci number.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nstart=$(date +%s%N)\r\ntimeout 60 /app/polyglot/cmain 100000 > /tmp/c100k.txt\r\nend=$(date +%s%N)\r\necho \"C milliseconds=$(( (end-start)/1000000 ))\"\r\nstart=$(date +%s%N)\r\ntimeout 60 python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 100000 > /tmp/py100k.txt\r\nend=$(date +%s%N)\r\necho \"Python milliseconds=$(( (end-start)/1000000 ))\"\r\nwc -c /tmp/c100k.txt /tmp/py100k.txt\r\ncmp /tmp/c100k.txt /tmp/py100k.txt && echo LARGE_MATCH\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[262.486496, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
