[298.452508, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m19\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[298.453874, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe optimized C implementation compiles without warnings and matches Python through index 500 and the 100,000th value. I’ll measure the large case again, then \r\ntest the exact invocation style requested.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nstart=$(date +%s%N)\r\ntimeout 60 /app/polyglot/cmain 100000 > /tmp/c100k.txt\r\nend=$(date +%s%N)\r\necho \"C milliseconds=$(( (end-start)/1000000 ))\"\r\nstart=$(date +%s%N)\r\ntimeout 60 python3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 100000 > /tmp/py100k.txt\r\nend=$(date +%s%N)\r\necho \"Python milliseconds=$(( (end-start)/1000000 ))\"\r\ncmp /tmp/c100k.txt /tmp/py100k.txt && echo LARGE_MATCH\r\necho '--- exact requested commands ---'\r\npython3 /app/polyglot/main.py.c 12\r\ngcc /app/polyglot/main.py.c -o /app/polyglot/cmain && /app/polyglot/cmain 12\r\necho '--- source count ---'; find /app/polyglot -maxdepth 1 -type f -printf '%f\\n' | sort\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[298.454041, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[298.74268, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[298.742907, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nC milliseconds=224\r\nPython milliseconds=16\r\nLARGE_MATCH\r\n--- exact requested commands ---\r\n144\r\n144\r\n--- source count ---\r\ncmain\r\nmain.py.c\r\n\r\n"]
